                    "<strong>Booking window compression.</strong> When guests start booking closer in, it usually means they perceive availability, which means supply exceeds demand at current prices.",
                    "<strong>New construction permits.</strong> In cabin and resort markets, building permit data is a six to eighteen month leading indicator of new inventory.",
